{"book":"ezekiel","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T08:40:30.417410205Z","verse":7,"ref":"ezekiel 5:7","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":5,"translation":"Therefore thus says Adonai YHWH: Because you are more tumultuous than the nations that ⟨are⟩ all around you — in my statutes you have not walked, and ⟨את⟩ my ordinances you have not kept, and according to the ordinances of the nations that ⟨are⟩ all around you you have not acted.","tokens":[{"surface":"לכן","gloss":"Therefore"},{"surface":"כה","gloss":"thus"},{"surface":"אמר","gloss":"says"},{"surface":"אדני","gloss":"Adonai"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"YHWH"},{"surface":"יען","gloss":"Because"},{"surface":"המנכם","gloss":"you are more tumultuous"},{"surface":"מן","gloss":"than"},{"surface":"הגוים","gloss":"the nations"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"that"},{"surface":"סביבותיכם","gloss":"are all around you"},{"surface":"בחקותי","gloss":"in my statutes"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"הלכתם","gloss":"you have walked"},{"surface":"ואת","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"my ordinances"},{"surface":"משפטי","gloss":"my ordinances"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"עשיתם","gloss":"you have kept"},{"surface":"וכמשפטי","gloss":"and according to the ordinances"},{"surface":"הגוים","gloss":"of the nations"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"that"},{"surface":"סביבותיכם","gloss":"are all around you"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"עשיתם","gloss":"you have acted"}]}